    "body": "Good timing! We are adding a pattern exactly for this case in https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/pull/1211 .\r\n\r\nI don't think using `cause` is appropriate here, because there was no inner exception thrown by some other subsystem, which this is wrapping. Also, `SyntaxError` does not contain column or line numbers.",
